sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Collect evidence and delegate access separately
accDescr: CloudTrail writes selected events to a protected log bucket. The external auditor assumes a limited role before reading that evidence.
participant AWS as AWS resource activity
participant CT as CloudTrail
participant S3 as Audit log bucket
participant Auditor
participant STS
AWS->>CT: Management and selected data events
CT->>S3: Retained audit logs
Auditor->>STS: AssumeRole with external ID
Note over STS: Trust policy verifies firm and external ID
STS-->>Auditor: Temporary audit-role credentials
Auditor->>S3: Read permitted log objects
S3-->>Auditor: Audit evidence
